 "note": "Kelpie water horse with a kelp mane and finned ears. Swim mount for two. Tame with Dried Kelp Blocks (1 in 6).",
 "ability_desc": "Swim mount for two (driver + passenger). On land it walks like a horse; in water the rider steers it through a ModelEngine meta controller: W swims the way they look (0.45 blocks/tick, faster than a sprinting swimmer), Space rises, Shift dives, nothing held treads water, and it can leap out at the surface. Rider and passenger get Water Breathing while riding. Unridden it swims after its owner. Bond (0 -> 5): ridden swim speed 0.45 -> 0.5 blocks/tick, unridden follow 0.35 -> 0.45.",
